The uncarried field is CHANNELS_DISABLED, and it is uncarried for a reason outside this tranche: preparation._config_for_profile lists it among seven HOST-OWNED fields and overwrites the operator's value BEFORE compile, so no carriage notice is ever emitted for it. That is parked P21, and it is why the reachable count is 24 and not 25.
